            "sid": "NUM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Musa giku Harun, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyithindho mir Israel bigonjo kubang’gi kubang’gi ng’atuman bang’ abera pare gire, ku giranyutha mi udi pa weggi: gibigonjo gbur ng’et hema mi cokri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ju m’ugonjo i ng’ete ma yo nyangu yo ku wokceng’ gibibedo mir abera mi gonjo pa Yuda, calkud udul migi: man Nacon ma wod Aminadab bibedo jadit mi nyithindho pa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul pare, kuju ma jukwanu welgi, gi rubanga pier abiro wi ang’wen ku dak abusiel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ju m’ugonjo i ng’ete bibedo suru pa Isakar: man Nethanel ma wod Zuar bibedo jadit mi nyithindho pa Isakar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul pare, ku ju ma jukwanu welgi, gi dhanu rubanga pier abic wi ang’wen ku dak ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man suru pa Zebulun: Eliab ma wod Helon bibedo jadit mi nyithindho pa Zebulun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul pare, ku ju ma jukwanu welgi, gi dhanu rubanga pier abic wi abiro ku dak ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanu ceke ma jukwanu welgi mi gonjo pa Yuda gi rubanga dak acel ku pier abora wi abusiel ku dak ang’wen calkud udul migi. Gibilar tugo woth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
