          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abera mi gonjo pa Dan calkud udul migi bibedo i ng’ete ma yor ariwa ma malu: man Ahiezer ma wod Amicadai bibedo jadit mi nyithindho pa Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul pare, ku ju m’i kindgi ma jukwanu welgi, gi rubanga pier abusiel wi ario ku dak abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man suru pa Acer gi ju ma gibigonjo i ng’ete: e Pagiel ma wod Okram bibedo jadit mi nyithindho pa Acer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul pare, ku ju m’i kindgi ma jukwanu welgi, gi rubanga pier ang’wen wi acel ku dak abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man suru pa Naftali: Ahira ma wod Enan bibedo jadit mi nyithindho pa Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul pare, ku ju m’i kindgi ma jukwanu welgi, gi rubanga pier abic wi adek ku dak ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhanu ceke ma jukwanu welgi mi gonjo pa Dan gi rubanga dak acel ku pier abic wi abiro ku dak abusiel. Gibitugo woth cen kud abera migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi ju ma jukwanu welgi mi nyithindho mir Israel ku ba udi pa weggi ku ba udi pa weggi: dhanu ceke ma jukwanu mi gonjo calkud udul migi gi dhanu rubanga dak abusiel ku wi adek ku dak abic ku pier abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.32",
